# Frontend ↔ API (GET)

Read `docs/api-frontend.md` before wiring home/recordings/clips/settings to the backend. Auth cookie rules: `docs/auth-frontend.md`.

- Call only through `apps/web/app/lib/api.ts` with `credentials: 'include'`.
- IDs are integers. JSON is camelCase. Times are ISO + `startMs`/`endMs` — format labels in the UI.
- Mock types (`proj_q3`, `updatedLabel`, `"41s"`) are view-models, not the API.
- Empty lists → `200 []`. Missing/not owned → `404 { "error": "Not found" }`. No cookie → `401`.
- Never render `storageKey`, real API keys, or `maskedKey` other than `"configured"` / `"not configured"`.
- Live data: `VITE_USE_MOCK_DATA=false`. Swagger: `/docs`.
- Upload ingest: follow `.cursor/rules/upload-ingest-frontend.mdc`. `POST /api/recordings` + poll `GET /api/recordings/:id/processing`.
- Clip export: `POST /api/recordings/:id/hooks/:hookId/export`, then poll `GET /api/clips/:id`. Download `videoUrl` (HTTPS Filestack only). Do not call generate summary/hooks, add-to-global-kb, or generic `POST /api/clips` yet (still 501).
